{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Game Overview**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a short third-person perspective visual novel.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will read the story through mouse clicks, while enjoying the illustrations and music.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Story Introduction**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this winter noon, the protagonist Su Mingxin meets her childhood friend Zhou Ying again.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some indescribable emotions are rekindled in her heart.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wants to see him, to have him stay by her side.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though she knows this is ultimately impossible.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Plot Summary**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mingxin, I'm back.&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After two years, she finally sees that familiar face again.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course she knows - he didn't return for her sake.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather, this might be the last chance for them to sit and talk together.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has no intention of changing anything. If such an opportunity truly existed, she would have probably turned this possibility into reality long ago.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Be sure to invite me to your wedding next year.&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She doesn't want to bid farewell like this, as if all their past was just meaningless events.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It doesn't matter. As long as he can be happy, that's enough.&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Operation Guide**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In dialogue interface:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Swipe mouse upward to top to open dropdown list  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Right-click to enter menu interface  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Feedback**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili: @\u7075\u865a\u4e4b\u5e7d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 901140212</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685540?t=1753026161","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685540?t=1753026161","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685540/689c31b0c11d23d3c9d49bda504bdff9f9465edf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753026161","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685540/689c31b0c11d23d3c9d49bda504bdff9f9465edf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753026161","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Game Overview**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a short third-person perspective visual novel.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will read the story through mouse clicks, while enjoying the illustrations and music.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Story Introduction**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this winter noon, the protagonist Su Mingxin meets her childhood friend Zhou Ying again.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some indescribable emotions are rekindled in her heart.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wants to see him, to have him stay by her side.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though she knows this is ultimately impossible.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Plot Summary**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mingxin, I'm back.&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After two years, she finally sees that familiar face again.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course she knows - he didn't return for her sake.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather, this might be the last chance for them to sit and talk together.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has no intention of changing anything. If such an opportunity truly existed, she would have probably turned this possibility into reality long ago.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Be sure to invite me to your wedding next year.&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She doesn't want to bid farewell like this, as if all their past was just meaningless events.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It doesn't matter. As long as he can be happy, that's enough.&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Operation Guide**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In dialogue interface:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Swipe mouse upward to top to open dropdown list  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Right-click to enter menu interface  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Feedback**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili: @\u7075\u865a\u4e4b\u5e7d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 901140212</p>","developers":["happiness\u4e34\u65f6\u5236\u4f5c\u7ec4"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685540/3586bbfaa29b2d90a366109c258a3a249ea3f11e/header.jpg?t=1753026161","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3685540/873838/4b566024981cd89a1cfe7b6658b0c784b0706130/1750402070/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745456863","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3685540/873838/4b566024981cd89a1cfe7b6658b0c784b0706130/1750402070/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745456863","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3685540/873838/4b566024981cd89a1cfe7b6658b0c784b0706130/1750402070/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745456863","id":257128277,"name":"pv-1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128277/c4bb11bf3a836ae486587100260d009523401969